PURPOSE

Explain why A43/A44 cooperative margin reinforcement
survives the first adverse hit
but fails across the second and third hits
in residual 5:3 contexts 46/47.

This diagnostic replays only
the already-frozen A44 primary worlds
with observational instrumentation added.

It does not change:

A44 outcomes;
qualification;
information-gain status;
thresholds;
arms;
worlds;
or F44.

MEASURED VARIABLES

For the favored committed cohort
frozen at each 5:3 adverse-pulse onset,
record before each adverse-epoch
committed-state decision:

raw same-side cooperative Q_margin;
same-side neighbor count;
own aligned margin M;
whether the cohort cell is still committed;
whether it defects in that epoch.

ARMS

D2_MARGIN_REINFORCE;
D2_PHASE_SWITCH;
D3_MARGIN_REINFORCE;
D3_PHASE_SWITCH.

